rmation about you. If you earned a lot, gaslight the others and pretend to be the victim\u00a0with your fake news version of the events. Maintain your position and reach the finals to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/643ebc1ed54e8c14d4b02f42ee1e7502.poster.avif?t=1770898290\" width=1024 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/643ebc1ed54e8c14d4b02f42ee1e7502.webm?t=1770898290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/643ebc1ed54e8c14d4b02f42ee1e7502.mp4?t=1770898290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secret Advantages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all else fails, spend some of your pennies to purchase Advantages. These are powerful consumable items that can turn the tide in your favor. Here are some fun examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an <strong>Amnesty</strong> to erase all votes on you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <strong>Scapegoat</strong> on another player and if you have the most votes, they will get voted out instead. <u>Scapegoats can chain!</u> If your target also used a Scapegoat, their target will get eliminated instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even skip having to persuade others to vote with you and just steal their vote with a <strong>Vote Buying</strong> advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Announce another player's pennies to everyone by using the <strong>Spotlight</strong> advantage. When used smartly, this could redirect attention away from you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can protect yourself from hostile attacks and boomerang the effect back to the user by using a <strong>Reflect</strong> advantage on yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all these devious advantages in the game, eliminations can often end with unpredictable results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/2398afe9454280282b9b54d3247e12b5.poster.avif?t=1770898290\" width=1024 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/2398afe9454280282b9b54d3247e12b5.webm?t=1770898290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/2398afe9454280282b9b54d3247e12b5.mp4?t=1770898290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend wisely. It's always better to survive a vote through sheer convincing power to avoid wasting pennies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defectors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got voted out early? Worry not. You will become a <strong>Defector</strong>. Defectors can still win by earning pennies in a completely different way. While active players continue competing in challenges, you can visit circus tents and play a different set of circus games to earn your pennies. These can then be used to influence the ongoing game by tempting active players with powerful offers! Some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immunity</strong>. If a player accepts this offer, they cannot be voted this round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote Switcher.</strong> A powerful tool that allows the player to switch the votes between two players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234140/extras/3bea188583d2b3f98bc6aac42dc643c6.poster.avif?t=1770898290